                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " At that time Herod the tetrarch heard about the fame of Jesus; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he said to his servants, “This is John the Baptist, he has been raised from the dead; that is why these powers are at work in him.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.6.17+MRK.6.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 6.17-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.3.19+LUK.3.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 3.19-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 18.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For Herod had seized John and bound him and put him in prison, for the sake of Herodi-as, his brother Philip's wife;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Other ancient authorities read",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "his brother's wife",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because John said to him, “It is not lawful for you to have her.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.6.19+MRK.6.20+MRK.6.21+MRK.6.22+MRK.6.23+MRK.6.24+MRK.6.25+MRK.6.26+MRK.6.27+MRK.6.28+MRK.6.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 6.19-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And though he wanted to put him to death, he feared the people, because they held him to be a prophet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when Herod's birthday came, the daughter of Herodi-as danced before the company, and pleased Herod, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so that he promised with an oath to give her whatever she might ask. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Prompted by her mother, she said, “Give me the head of John the Baptist here on a platter.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the king was sorry; but because of his oaths and his guests he commanded it to be given; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he sent and had John beheaded in the prison, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and his head was brought on a platter and given to the girl, and she brought it to her mother. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And his disciples came and took the body and buried it; and they went and told Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
