              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 15.32-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Now when Jesus heard this, he withdrew from there in a boat to a lonely place apart. But when the crowds heard it, they followed him on foot from the towns. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As he went ashore he saw a great throng; and he had compassion on them, and healed their sick. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When it was evening, the disciples came to him and said, “This is a lonely place, and the day is now over; send the crowds away to go into the villages and buy food for themselves.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus said, “They need not go away; you give them something to eat.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They said to him, “We have only five loaves here and two fish.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said, “Bring them here to me.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 14.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.24.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 24.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Then he ordered the crowds to sit down on the grass; and taking the five loaves and the two fish he looked up to heaven, and blessed, and broke and gave the loaves to the disciples, and the disciples gave them to the crowds. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they all ate and were satisfied. And they took up twelve baskets full of the broken pieces left over. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And those who ate were about five thousand men, besides women and children.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
